  "text": "That is a very heavy burden to carry, Charles. It makes total sense that you feel stretched thin when you're trying to be the rock for Margaret while you're also feeling shaky yourself.\n\nRemember what we talked about before regarding Emily's hospitalization: even Margaret and you are human beings who need support, not just people who give it. You don't have to solve all their financial worries right this second, or fix your own feelings perfectly to help her. Sometimes, just acknowledging that *you* are struggling too can relieve some of the pressure to \"be strong\" all the time.\n\nHave you tried telling her how hard these last few months have been on you specifically? Even if she knows you're stressed, hearing it directly might help you both vent instead of holding it inside until it boils over again.",
